### Criar cliente PF
# @name criarCliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "João da Silva",
  "documento": "39053344705",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "telefone": "11987654321"
}

### Capturar id: @clienteId = {{criarCliente.response.body.id}}

### Buscar cliente por documento (com máscara)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes?documento=390.533.447-05
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obter cliente por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar clientes paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes?pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar cliente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
  "telefone": "11988887777"
}

### Adicionar veículo
# @name addVeic
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/veiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "ABC1234",
  "marca": "Fiat",
  "modelo": "Uno",
  "ano": 2020
}

### Listar veículos do cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/veiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar veículo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/veiculos/ABC1234
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Volkswagen",
  "modelo": "Gol",
  "ano": 2018
}

### Remover veículo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}/veiculos/ABC1234
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inativar cliente (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clientes/{{clienteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tentar criar cliente com CPF inválido (esperado 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Inválido",
  "documento": "11111111111",
  "email": "x@y.com",
  "telefone": "11987654321"
}

### Tentar criar cliente sem token (esperado 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Sem auth",
  "documento": "39053344705",
  "email": "x@y.com",
  "telefone": "11987654321"
}
